Meta tooling
------------
RoadLens uses Meta SAM 3.1 through its public local and hosted interfaces. SAM
model code and checkpoints are separate works governed by the SAM License:
https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3/blob/main/LICENSE

The remote backend uses Meta's official meta_sam_parser and OpenAI-compatible
Model API. No Meta model weights or source code are distributed in this repository.
